      "id": "msg_0857_SC01R0206_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Someone broke my Pokémon-catching\n",
        "record!\r",
        "I’ll reclaim my record and regain\n",
        "my place in the standings!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0857_SC01R0206_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "My name isn’t on the rankings?\n",
        "What kind of nonsense is that?!\r",
        "...It’s because I’ve never taken\n",
        "part in a Contest.\r",
        "I bet it’d feel great if I could\n",
        "be number one here!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0857_SC01R0206_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "I really don’t win many battles...\n",
        "But it doesn’t get me down.\r",
        "I’m trying for the world record\n",
        "at Pokémon fishing!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0857_SC01R0206_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Sorry, I’m still fine-tuning this\n",
        "thingy here."
      ]
    }
  ]
}